sequenceDiagram
participant Job as "paymentMonitorJob: Control"
participant Receivable as "retailerReceivableService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
participant Notify as "notificationService: Service"
Job->>+Receivable: findOverdueReceivables(currentDate)
Receivable->>+DB: Read due dates, outstanding and disputed values
DB-->>-Receivable: Overdue scoped receivables
loop Each overdue receivable
    Receivable->>DB: Append overdue event and reminder history
    Receivable->>Notify: sendPaymentReminder(retailer, order)
end
Notify->>DB: Persist notification/outbox result
Receivable-->>-Job: Reminder sweep result
Note over Receivable,DB: Pending disputed value is excluded from collectible now calculation


